{"3994460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Farmer", "steam_appid": 3994460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Sylvester. A farmer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/dde6cf2dc583b36f4894a3e3b99e5218.avif?t=1784651925\" width=1516 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your quiet farm life is interrupted by a new type of war. Killer drones fill the sky and patrols trample your crops.<br>But you remember the old ways of the shovel, the rifle and the watering can.  <br><br>Has the world left you behind or will traditional methods prevail?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farming sim meets —</strong> <strong>survival shooter, amidst a drone war.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/c55a9a627f8cd7e6592ff31a849de8b5.poster.avif?t=1784651925\" width=960 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/c55a9a627f8cd7e6592ff31a849de8b5.webm?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/c55a9a627f8cd7e6592ff31a849de8b5.mp4?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get vegetable quotas from government TV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find seeds, compost and crop land to help grow vegetables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your crops from FPV drones and enemy patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/6f6865992150b2a194a621e22adc9157.poster.avif?t=1784651925\" width=960 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/6f6865992150b2a194a621e22adc9157.webm?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/6f6865992150b2a194a621e22adc9157.mp4?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control an agricultural drone to do farm work remotely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with the drone about farming, fighting and morality of action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall asleep in front of the TV inside the safety of your bunker</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An AI future. With personality.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/8f28d4fb2ef43edc73be83158599ba39.avif?t=1784651925\" width=1516 height=322 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A data center across the border drained the water and all the crops died.<br>Our troops went to stop it — but we got invaded instead.<br><br>You must farm to feed the front, defending potatoes and carrots from automated enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isolated but not alone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/00f993c8981303bdb624a07da17ad874.avif?t=1784651925\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras_big/00f993c8981303bdb624a07da17ad874.webp?t=1784651925 width=1560 height=673 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALEX.AI (Advanced Learning Experience) will assist you with your crops.<br>He's got a water cannon, a hook-shot, and an opinion.<br><br>The more Sylvester and ALEX.AI work together, the more they learn from each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Government TV. Vegetable quotas.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/85e829ff5b5f10565cdd1251d61f9447.poster.avif?t=1784651925\" width=960 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/85e829ff5b5f10565cdd1251d61f9447.webm?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/85e829ff5b5f10565cdd1251d61f9447.mp4?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be told what to produce.<br>You will be told what to buy. You will do both.<br><br>Big brother knows better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farmers need to eat too.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/fe9571d184e01a6cc641b28f18530dbe.avif?t=1784651925\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras_big/fe9571d184e01a6cc641b28f18530dbe.webp?t=1784651925 width=1560 height=657 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed yourself foods to stay effective and boost performance. <br>Canned cow anus fills you right up. Or would you prefer synthesized speed peas instead?<br><br>Try not to eat your crops, or you'll miss the quota.<br><br><strong>Drone Farmer is a single player FPS farming experience with a set narrative and multiple endings.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Sylvester. A farmer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/dde6cf2dc583b36f4894a3e3b99e5218.avif?t=1784651925\" width=1516 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your quiet farm life is interrupted by a new type of war. Killer drones fill the sky and patrols trample your crops.<br>But you remember the old ways of the shovel, the rifle and the watering can.  <br><br>Has the world left you behind or will traditional methods prevail?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farming sim meets —</strong> <strong>survival shooter, amidst a drone war.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/c55a9a627f8cd7e6592ff31a849de8b5.poster.avif?t=1784651925\" width=960 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/c55a9a627f8cd7e6592ff31a849de8b5.webm?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/c55a9a627f8cd7e6592ff31a849de8b5.mp4?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get vegetable quotas from government TV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find seeds, compost and crop land to help grow vegetables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your crops from FPV drones and enemy patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/6f6865992150b2a194a621e22adc9157.poster.avif?t=1784651925\" width=960 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/6f6865992150b2a194a621e22adc9157.webm?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/6f6865992150b2a194a621e22adc9157.mp4?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control an agricultural drone to do farm work remotely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with the drone about farming, fighting and morality of action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall asleep in front of the TV inside the safety of your bunker</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An AI future. With personality.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/8f28d4fb2ef43edc73be83158599ba39.avif?t=1784651925\" width=1516 height=322 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A data center across the border drained the water and all the crops died.<br>Our troops went to stop it — but we got invaded instead.<br><br>You must farm to feed the front, defending potatoes and carrots from automated enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Isolated but not alone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/00f993c8981303bdb624a07da17ad874.avif?t=1784651925\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras_big/00f993c8981303bdb624a07da17ad874.webp?t=1784651925 width=1560 height=673 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALEX.AI (Advanced Learning Experience) will assist you with your crops.<br>He's got a water cannon, a hook-shot, and an opinion.<br><br>The more Sylvester and ALEX.AI work together, the more they learn from each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Government TV. Vegetable quotas.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/85e829ff5b5f10565cdd1251d61f9447.poster.avif?t=1784651925\" width=960 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/85e829ff5b5f10565cdd1251d61f9447.webm?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/85e829ff5b5f10565cdd1251d61f9447.mp4?t=1784651925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be told what to produce.<br>You will be told what to buy. You will do both.<br><br>Big brother knows better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farmers need to eat too.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras/fe9571d184e01a6cc641b28f18530dbe.avif?t=1784651925\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/extras_big/fe9571d184e01a6cc641b28f18530dbe.webp?t=1784651925 width=1560 height=657 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed yourself foods to stay effective and boost performance. <br>Canned cow anus fills you right up. Or would you prefer synthesized speed peas instead?<br><br>Try not to eat your crops, or you'll miss the quota.<br><br><strong>Drone Farmer is a single player FPS farming experience with a set narrative and multiple endings.</strong></p>", "short_description": "First-person farming sim in the middle of a drone war. Shoot down AI drones and explore the village to find seeds and ammo. Use your farm drone to fulfill vegetable quotas faster. Will you let AI replace you, or will humanity prevail?", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/a27a503658e7d5f09dc136ba3ae247abc5c0589b/header.jpg?t=1784651925", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/015ce17275f67be272ab133d079dd3f947fdf934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784651925", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994460/015ce17275f67be272ab133d079dd3f947fdf934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784651925", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1070 8GB or Radeon equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 /AMD Ryzen 7 2700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060 8GB or Radeon equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "All rights reserved 2026", "developers": ["Rockit Industries"], "publishers": ["Rockit Industries"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "